21,"Paris - The City of Light","International",4,465421.00,"{6}","Paris is a natural starting point for guided tours that pair landmark sights with time to soak up café culture and neighbourhood charm. Many itineraries include a city tour, plus classic moments such as a River Seine cruise, views from the Eiffel Tower, and an excursion to Versailles. Beyond the capital, routes often introduce northern France, with stops such as Rouen and Normandy, while other trips travel via Lyon, Dijon or Strasbourg before returning to Paris",True,"uploads/packages/cover/d4a2976a71e746d3985c5f407f5d63c3.jpg","{""Eiffel Tower"",""Louvre Museum"",Sainte-Chapelle,""Le Marais"",Saint-Germain-des-Prés}","[{""day"": 1, ""title"": ""Iconic Landmarks & Historic Walking Tour"", ""description"": ""Morning arrival in Paris followed by hotel check-in. Spend the afternoon exploring the banks of the Seine, walking through the Tuileries Garden, and visiting the historic Sainte-Chapelle chapel. End your evening taking in the panoramic views and glittering lights from the Eiffel Tower.""}, {""day"": 2, ""title"": ""World-Class Art & Trendy Le Marais"", ""description"": ""Dedicate your morning to exploring the vast masterpiece collections of the Louvre Museum. In the afternoon, head east to the vibrant Le Marais neighborhood to explore its medieval architecture, trendy boutiques, and famous food scene on Rue des Rosiers.""}, {""day"": 3, ""title"": ""Bohemian Montmartre & Scenic Seine Cruise"", ""description"": ""Spend the morning wandering the steep cobblestone streets, portrait artist squares, and the Sacré-Cœur Basilica in hilltop Montmartre. In the afternoon, descend to the historic Saint-Germain-des-Prés district for sidewalk café culture, and wrap up the day with a relaxing sunset river cruise.""}, {""day"": 4, ""title"": ""Palace of Versailles Day Trip & Departure"", ""description"": ""Take a short RER train ride to the magnificent Palace of Versailles to tour the Hall of Mirrors and its expa